sequenceDiagram
    participant PlatformOp as ODH Platform Operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant RayOp as ray-module-operator<br/>controller-manager
    participant Manifests as Vendored Manifests<br/>/opt/manifests

    Note over PlatformOp,RayOp: Flow 1: Ray CR Reconciliation

    PlatformOp->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Ray CR (default-ray)<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>RayOp: Watch event: Ray CR change
    RayOp->>K8sAPI: Read Ray CR spec<br/>ServiceAccount token
    RayOp->>RayOp: Evaluate management state
    RayOp->>K8sAPI: Check cert-manager CRDs present<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>RayOp: CRD availability result
    RayOp->>Manifests: Copy to writable temp dir
    RayOp->>RayOp: Kustomize render + inject<br/>RELATED_IMAGE_* params
    RayOp->>RayOp: Filter platform resources<br/>(strip SCC on non-OpenShift)
    RayOp->>RayOp: Create notebook RBAC<br/>(ray ClusterRole)
    RayOp->>K8sAPI: Server-Side Apply KubeRay manifests<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>RayOp: Apply result
    RayOp->>K8sAPI: Monitor deployment health<br/>ServiceAccount token
    RayOp->>K8sAPI: Update Ray CR status<br/>ServiceAccount token

    Note over PlatformOp,RayOp: Flow 2: Platform ConfigMap Watch

    PlatformOp->>K8sAPI: Create/Update odh-ray-config ConfigMap<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>RayOp: Watch event: ConfigMap change<br/>(filtered by name predicate)
    RayOp->>K8sAPI: Read ConfigMap (distribution info)<br/>ServiceAccount token
    RayOp->>K8sAPI: Re-reconcile Ray CR with<br/>updated distribution metadata
    RayOp->>K8sAPI: Update Ray CR status.distribution<br/>ServiceAccount token
